<td id="S6.T2.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S6.T2.2.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Outlier concentration (Hadamard) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">Tseng et al. (2025)</a></cite></span></td>
<td id="S6.T2.2.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
