</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A0.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">.4 </span>Testing <span id="A0.SS4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SmoothSwiGLU</span>, tensor scaling and SR</h3>

<div id="A0.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A0.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We replicate the results in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chmiel et al. (2025)</a></cite> more exactly by adding the <span id="A0.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SmoothSwiGLU</span> in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">Fishman et al. (2025)</a></cite>. We could not replicate their indicated results on models up to LLama 1B in <a href="#A0.F6" title="In .4 Testing SmoothSwiGLU, tensor scaling and SR ‣ Elucidating the Design Space of FP4 training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> and <a href="#A0.T6" title="In .4 Testing SmoothSwiGLU, tensor scaling and SR ‣ Elucidating the Design Space of FP4 training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A0.F6" class="ltx_figure">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Training and validation performance curves LLama with SSwiGLU. The gap between <span id="A0.F6.3" class="ltx_text">BFLOAT16</span> still grows with model size depsite tensor scaling and SR.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
<figure id="A0.F6.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.17791v1/llama_9M_SSWIG_curves.svg" id="A0.F6.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/384;" width="548" height="384"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>Llama 9M</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
<figure id="A0.F6.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.17791v1/llama_60M_SSWIG_curves.svg" id="A0.F6.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/384;" width="548" height="384"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>Llama 60M</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
<figure id="A0.F6.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.17791v1/llama_350M_SSWIG_curves.svg" id="A0.F6.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/384;" width="548" height="384"></object>
